<h3 style="margin: 0; padding: 5px 0;"><span class="multilang" lang="en">Challenge 12 — Global Meeting - a One-on-One Lesson (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="ja">チャレンジ 12 ― グローバルミーティング：マンツーマンレッスン (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="ko">챌린지 12 — 글로벌 미팅 - 일대일 레슨 (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="es">Desafío 12: Reunión global - Una lección uno a uno (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="de">Challenge 12 – Globales Meeting - Eine Einzelstunde (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="fr">Défi 12 — Réunion globale - Un cours particulier (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="pt">Desafio 12 — Reunião Global - Uma Aula Particular (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="bg">Предизвикателство 12 — Глобална среща - Индивидуален урок (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="ru">Испытание 12 — Глобальная встреча — Индивидуальный урок (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="ar">التحدي 12 — اجتماع عالمي - درس فردي (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="hi">चुनौती 12 — वैश्विक बैठक - एक-на-एक पाठ (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="zh_tw">挑戰 12 ― 全球會議 - 一對一課程 (10xp)</span> <span class="multilang" lang="zh_cn">挑战 12 ― 全球会议 - 一对一课程 (10xp)</span></h3>
